  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDF GRANT FOR INSTITUTIONAL CAP. BLDG. -AUDITOR GEN.OFF. ARG.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activities under this grant  all relate to the training of professional  audit staff of AGN in the use of modern computer assisted audit techniques. An innovative approach is proposed whereby a private audit firm will be contracted to perform audits jointly with the AGN ( co-sourcing) and afford AGN  their suite of audit software and through application of the firms standard training course,  but principally through the joint audits, train the  AGN staff in use of these techniques.</narrative>
  </description>
